==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.27~0.67 seconds<sup>8f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 14~26.67 seconds<sup>420f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use a combination of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to slowly whittle down at Master A. while you build up money. Once he's dealt with, Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] can help deal with the Ottas. Ranged units, specifically [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] are especially useful for handling THE SLOTH—[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] will help expedite this process.

